{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月15日 17:57 星期日</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月15日 18:05 星期日</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>渣打藝趣嘉年華「壓軸巡遊」今日（15日）下午在銅鑼灣舉行，大批市民圍觀。本文短片帶讀者現場一睹不同巨型木偶和表演者的風采，感受銅鑼灣鬧市變身流動童話世界的氛圍。（拍攝及剪接：歐蕙瑩）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:59:31.139550+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:57:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:53:27.519314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:53:27.519314+00:00","content_hash":"0f5b993febe5c02ee42247384245270bf93cbdf5707a6eb21614b344838f2a82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}